WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.533
A job on the phone: materials, photos, notes, problems.

00:00:05.233 --> 00:00:11.800
The job. The job number, the day of the job, the customer and the address, with Directions and Call.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:17.133
Directions. Opens maps with the address. Call rings the customer.

00:00:17.633 --> 00:00:25.433
What we're doing. The work, in the office's words, and any note for the crew. No prices: the crew phone never shows money.

00:00:25.933 --> 00:00:31.900
Materials to load. Tap each item when it's on the truck. The office sees what was loaded.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:36.567
Photos. The arrival and finish photos, and any you add.

00:00:37.067 --> 00:00:41.733
Add photos. Take as many as you need, add what they show, and save.

00:00:42.233 --> 00:00:47.567
Notes. A note for the office: it shows on the job in the office straight away.

00:00:48.067 --> 00:00:51.267
Write a note. Type it, then Save the note.

00:00:51.767 --> 00:00:59.733
Report a problem. A broken pipe, the wrong pavers, an unhappy customer: it becomes an office ticket, with photos.

00:01:00.233 --> 00:01:05.500
What's wrong. Say what's wrong, add photos if they help, and send it to the office.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:10.967
That's it. The crew app speaks Spanish too, when the phone app is set to Spanish.
